{"id":"msg_m_ex_brid_05","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_brid","label":"Brid · Nikke"},"label":"5. Commander.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_brid_04","next":"msg_m_ex_brid_06","speakers":{"brid":"Brid"},"icons":{"brid":"si_c070_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_1","text":"Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_2","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_2","text":"Yes?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_3","text":"I have a non-work-related question,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_4","text":"so I'm a bit hesitant to ask...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_5","text":"It's okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_6","text":"Did you know that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_7","text":"people around you call me","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_8","text":"a workaholic?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_9","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_9","text":"To be honest, I've been calling you that too.","jump":"m_ex_brid_05_11"},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_10","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_10","text":"This is the first I've heard of it.","jump":"m_ex_brid_05_16"},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_11","text":"What?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_12","text":"You have?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_13","text":"I mean, it's not entirely inaccurate, and I don't mind it all that much,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_14","text":"though I do find it a tad exaggerated.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_15","text":"It's a bit disconcerting, I must admit.","jump":"m_ex_brid_05_22"},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_16","text":"Sure,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_17","text":"I may have slept less than 30 hours last week,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_18","text":"but that's hardly grounds","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_19","text":"for calling me a workaholic.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_20","text":"That's a classic case of a workaholic.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_21","text":"Is that so?","jump":"m_ex_brid_05_22"},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_22","text":"Do you not like it when people call you that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_23","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_24","text":"It sometimes has a positive connotation, you know?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_25","text":"Yeah,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_26","text":"I think so too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_27","text":"It's not uncommon for one to become so enraptured by something","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_28","text":"that it sparks a mild obsession, wouldn't you agree?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_29","text":"For example?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_30","text":"Someone you know quite well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_31","text":"Anis.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_32","text":"She's a bona fide sodaholic.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_33","text":"Very true.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_34","text":"And Neon.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_35","text":"She's obsessed with the intangible concept of firepower,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_36","text":"so much so that she constantly goes around shouting it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_37","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_37","text":"True that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_38","text":"What about you, Commander? What is it that captivates you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_39","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_39","text":"I think I'm also a workaholic.","jump":"m_ex_brid_05_41"},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_40","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_40","text":"Honestly? I think I'm a Bridholic.","jump":"m_ex_brid_05_45"},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_41","text":"I appreciate you","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_42","text":"trying to make me feel better,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_43","text":"yet from my perspective,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_44","text":"you don't qualify.","jump":"m_ex_brid_05_47"},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_45","text":"I was being serious, you know...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_46","text":"I wasn't expecting a joke in response.","jump":"m_ex_brid_05_47"},{"id":"m_ex_brid_05_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_brid_05_47","text":"Anyway, I'm sorry to have bothered you during work.","jump":null}],"chat":true}